interprocess communication (C/C++ only).
* Argument Parser: Facilitate processing the arguments passed into a C/C++ program
(argv) (C/C++ only).
* Universal Scope Name: Create a Universal Scope Name (USN) representation for
hierarchical scopes in SystemVerilog and VHDL.

