Check if the given handle is a signal object recognized in the NPI Language Model.
The API npi_ut_is_signal returns true for all the object types belonging to the Expression
class except for npiOperation and belonging to the Vh Expression class except for literal,
attribute, npiVhOperation, npiVhAggregate and npiVhIndexVar; otherwise, return false.

npi_ut_is_signal ( npiHandle hdl );

hdl

