Get parameter information for a scope object.
The returned vector contains the parameter handle, decompiled expression, final value,
and default value.
The API npi_ut_get_param_info_by_scope collects value information of all parameters
under the given scope.
The value information contains four elements: the parameter object, a string for the
decompiled expression, a string for the final value, and a string for the default value.
The API helps users check whether the value of a parameter is overridden.

