fullexclude_module.fsm File
In a fullexclude_module.fsm file, the header and the format of dumping remains same
as that of the fullexclude.fsm file, but it contains exclusion entries of all the excludable
objects for FSM coverage at the module level. You can edit this file to exclude objects for
FSM coverage at the module level (for all instances of the module).
