Callback invoked after a tenure is ended by calling vmm_perf_analyzer::end_tenure(),
aborted by calling vmm_perf_analyzer::abort_tenure() or explicitly added using
vmm_perf_analyzer::add_tenure(). The performance data associated with the tenure may
be modified.
If the start, end or active times are modified to be invalid or inconsistent, an error message
is issued and the tenured is filtered out.
If the filtered argument is TRUE after all of the registered callbacks have been called, the
tenure will not be added to the database.
