Passes the value of a scalar reg or bit to a vc_handle by reference. The previous example
also shows a use of vc_putScalar().
char vc_toChar(vc_handle)
Returns the 0, 1, x, or z character. For example:
void print_scalar(vc_handle h) {
printf("%c", vc_toChar(h));
