Pattern Matching for Tagged Union
VCS supports the pattern matching of tagged union expressions in if-else conditional
statements, case statements as specified in the Section 12.6 of the IEEE Standard
System Verilog LRM 1800-2012.
The following examples shows the usage of pattern matching.
Example 54 Usage of Pattern Matching for Tagged Union in if-else Conditional Statement
typedef union tagged packed {
int Valid;
struct packed {
bit [4:0] reg1, reg2, regd;
} Add;
} Instr;

module test;
Instr i1;
int v;

