capacitor primitive:
Example 106 Parameters Generated in the Shadow Module of Capacitor Primitive
spicemodule capacitor(p, n);
parameter real c = 3.0000000000000004e-09;
parameter real ic = 0.0000000000000000;

inout p;
output n;
